      * PARITY07 copybook: names for COPY ... REPLACING
       01 WS-OLD            PIC X(4) VALUE 'old'.
       01 WS-OLD-X          PIC X(4) VALUE 'oldx'.
       01 :TAG:-A           PIC X(4) VALUE 'taga'.
       01 B-:TAG:           PIC X(4) VALUE 'tagb'.
       01 C-(TAG)-D         PIC X(4) VALUE 'ctd'.
       01 P-FLD             PIC X(4) VALUE 'pfld'.
       01 Q                 PIC X(4) VALUE 'q'.
       01 PRE-NAME          PIC X(4) VALUE 'pren'.
